Package: threadbridge
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: armhf
Maintainer: kodi-extras
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), libstdc++6, libgcc-s1, iptables, ipset, iproute2, kmod
Description: Thread border router (OTBR) for an 802.15.4 USB dongle
 Runs otbr-agent from ot-br-posix (@OTBR_TAG@) against a USB dongle with
 OpenThread RCP firmware, so the box routes between its Ethernet or Wi-Fi
 network and a Thread network. The REST API serves Home Assistant and the
 Kodi add-on script.service.threadbridge. Packaged for OSMC on the Vero V.
